s ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:42:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692854","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126510-1843481262696829","game_id":"steam-5126510","kind":"announcement","title":"OVERDUE’s Demo Overhaul Is Here","summary":"A major update to the OVERDUE demo is here. We’ve revisited the first three nights, expanded the mystery surrounding Bellweather Library, and worked through the rough edges players have been finding during testing.Some of the most useful feedback was about the moments that interrupted the atmosphere: a task that wasn’t clear, an awkward item grip, furniture disappearing as you turned, or a scare that didn’t play out properly for everyone in co-op. Those reports helped shape this update.Here’s wh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T02:06:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696829","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126510-1842846814447069","game_id":"steam-5126510","kind":"update","title":"OVERDUE demo update","summary":"Thanks to everyone sending reports through the SEND A REPORT button and leaving reviews.A lot of you found the same handful of problems. This update fixes them.CATALOG CARDSIf the card filing job was assigned to you and the cabinet was empty, that was a real bug.The pile was only ever stocked once, so the second person to get the job found bare wood.It restocks properly now, every time the job comes around.PHONE CALLS IN OTHER LANGUAGESAnswering the phone showed the boss in English even when you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T16:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447069","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126510-1842212951312008","game_id":"steam-5126510","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Bug Fixes","summary":"Fixed the 1921 flashbacks rendering with no atmosphere, a patron getting stuck when their book was reshelved.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T02:41:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951312008","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5126510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5126510":"2026-10-26T08:43:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5126510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:15Z"},"5148500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:16Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5126510","app_id":5126510,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"8f59c50340af95dde2fea65fe67d3c193f6cccaa8f74dd8a783a7864ffaa2955","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"귀신 들린 도서관에서 혼자 또는 최대 세 명의 친구와 야간 근무를 하세요. 수상한 이용객을 돕고, 업무를 마치고, 서가 사이에 도사린 존재로부터 살아남으세요. 급여를 벌고 규칙을 지키며 벨웨더가 묻으려 했던 과거를 밝혀내세요.","publisher